💭 A mutation fuzzer for the HTTP engine. It takes valid requests, damages them,
💭 plays them to the diagnostic app over the in-memory wire, and checks that what
💭 comes back is still a well-formed sequence of responses. A panic anywhere in
💭 the engine ends this program, which is the other thing it is looking for.
💭
💭 It also watches its own memory: the engine keeps nothing between
💭 conversations, so a run that keeps growing has found a leak.
💭
💭   FUZZ_CASES      how many cases to run                        (default 100000)
💭   FUZZ_SEED       which family of cases                        (default 1)
💭   FUZZ_CASE       run only this case and show it
💭   FUZZ_TRACE      print each case number first, to find the one that crashes
💭   FUZZ_GROWTH_KB  how much the process may grow after warm-up  (default 2048)
💭
💭 Built into build/bin/grapevine-fuzz.
